{
  "id": "blackfountain",
  "name": "OBNE Black Fountain Stereo",
  "transport": "obne",
  "noNotes": true,
  "folder": "OBNE Black Fountain Stereo",
  "source": "Old Blood Noise Endeavors, Black Fountain (OL2) instruction manual 2025-03-21 pp. 4-5 (MIDI functions + CC table), https://oldbloodnoise.com/s/20250321-Instruction-Manual-Black-Fountain-OL2.pdf",
  "obne": {
    "cc": 28,
    "start": 64,
    "confirm": 127
  },
  "liveNote": "the Black Fountain can't be asked anything — live controls, preset select, and store (saved over MIDI; edit keeps its own copy)",
  "setup": [
    "MIDI in only: interface out → the pedal's MIDI IN (3.5mm TRS Type A). Its MIDI OUT is a thru — chain the next pedal off it.",
    "Default channel is 1. To move it, send CC 102 = new channel (1-16) on the current channel; give each chained pedal its own.",
    "Nothing can be read back: edit's copy of each preset you store here is the record (back it up from the library panel).",
    "What edit shows is the whole preset: store sends every control, so set the ones you didn't touch too (they start at noon; dry at full).",
    "Clock: it follows MIDI clock by default (delay time syncs) — set clock mode below to change that."
  ],
